          ":question/id": "60ff0898-484c-5468-ab70-2a2b8951960b",
          ":question/math-academy-id": "q-13536",
          ":question/problem": "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>",
          ":question/worked-solution": "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-C-(B-C) & =A+B-C-B+C \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
        },
        {
          ":db/id": 17592186233433,
          ":question/difficulty": {
            ":db/ident": ":question.difficulty/easy"
          },
          ":question/id": "d2422983-d4c6-5d6a-a655-61aaf19ac8a1",
          ":question/math-academy-id": "q-13550",
          ":question/problem": "Find $K+L-(K+J)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$J=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$K=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$L=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 6 \\\\ 6 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>",
          ":question/worked-solution": "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}K+L-(K+J) & =K+L-K-J \\\\  & =\\cancel{K}+L-\\cancel{K}-J \\\\  & =L-J\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L-J & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 6 \\\\ 6 & 6\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6-5 & 6-2 \\\\ 6-2 & 6-1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
        },
